Subject: [PATCH] fixup! arm64: dts: apple: t[603x,8122]: Add speaker/jack
 nodes

Signed-off-by: sofus <sofus.c@icloud.com>
(cherry picked from commit 99ea26bcd904f64d307491b2407b4feae5de03f4)
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6030-j514s.dts | 2 +-
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6030-j516s.dts | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6030-j514s.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6030-j514s.dts
index aa5db1e84483..724d94dc6557 100644
